    MARKUS @ shock "ソ…ソレは冗談ですよね…。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:24
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_1f2d9a15:

    # "Markus' confusion and shock soon turned to frustration, and then finally anger."
    "マルクスの混乱とショックは、やがて焦燥へ、そしてついには怒りへと変わっていった。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:25
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_6e3b82dd:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Those fucking bastards!"
    MARKUS @ angry "くそったれ!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:26
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_4a7d71c0:

    # MARKUS @ sad "All these years..."
    MARKUS @ sad "これまでの年月…"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:27
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_4784b9d3:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Nothing but lies!"
    MARKUS @ angry "嘘ばかり!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:28
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_17b31c2a:

    # MC @ talk "We've always known we were being lied to about certain things."
    MC @ talk "私たちは特定のことについて嘘をつかれていると、ずっと知っていた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:29
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_b12d1541:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Not this! Not fucking this!"
    MARKUS @ angry "これだけは嫌!　くそったれ、これだけはダメだ!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:30
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_95a99166:

    # MARKUS "Surely you can't agree with what they've done?"
    MARKUS "彼らのしたことを、あなたは認められないでしょう？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:33
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_c399b696:

    # MARKUS @ angry "What? How can you say that!"
    MARKUS @ angry "えっ？なんてことを言うの!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:34
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_a2cc5969:

    # MC @ talk "What does it really change?"
    MC @ talk "結局のところ、何が変わるのでしょう？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:35
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_329e2755:

    # MC @ talk "If the Demorai really aren't willing to stop, should people really know?"
    MC @ talk "デモライが本当に止める気がないなら、人々は知るべきなのか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:36
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_6fc25b58:

    # MC @ talk "I mean, doesn't it make it {i}easier{/i} to fight them thinking they really are just savage beasts?"
    MC @ talk "つまり、本当にただの獣だと思い込んだほうが、戦い{i}やすく{/i}ならないか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:37
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_034b71f7:

    # MC @ talk "Do {i}you{/i} really want to be thinking every time we have fight one of those things about who they are?"
    MC @ talk "{i}あなた{/i}は、あんなものと戦うたびに、相手が誰だったのかを毎回考えたいのですか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:38
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_0fa3928a:

    # MC @ talk "{i}Do they have families? Children and loved ones waiting at home like us? Do they mourn when their brothers and sisters fall?{/i}"
    MC @ talk "{i}彼らにも家族がいるのだろうか？　我々のように家で待つ子供や愛する者がいるのだろうか？　兄弟姉妹が倒れれば、彼らも悲しむのだろうか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:39
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_b1427ed4:

    # MC @ talk "Are those the kind of questions you really want to be putting in people's heads during a war?"
    MC @ talk "戦時中に、そんな疑問を人々の頭に置きたいのですか？"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:41
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_df78f4bd:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Who knows what else they've been keeping from us."
    MARKUS @ angry "一体、他に何を隠しているか分かったものではない。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:43
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_f0f60350:

    # MC @ talk "That Demorai... That girl back in those ruins, Sypha."
    MC @ talk "あのデモライ…例の廃墟にいたあの娘、サイファ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:45
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_40666aed:

    # MC @ talk "She led us out safely like she said she would."
    MC @ talk "彼女は言っていた通りに、私たちを無事に導き出してくれた。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:46
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_0750dbb7:

    # MC @ talk "AND she showed a willingness to work together... That means there has to be hope for other Demorai to do the same."
    MC @ talk "それに彼女は協力する意思を見せてくれた…なら、他のデモライにも同じ希望があるはずだ。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:48
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_4f5c25bc:

    # MC @ talk "She tried to help us and... We didn't listen."
    MC @ talk "彼女は私たちを助けようとしたのに...私たちは聞かなかった"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:49
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_e7a5d09d:

    # MC @ talk "{i}She was telling the truth.{/i}"
    MC @ talk "{i}彼女は真実を語っていた。{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:50
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_b4a91270:

    # MC @ talk "If we can't keep our minds open at all to even the {i}possibility{/i} of negotiations or peace, we rule them out entirely before they have a chance."
    MC @ talk "交渉や平和の可能性すら、常に心を開いておけなければ、我々はそれを試みる機会もないうちに完全に排除してしまう。"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:51
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_02222f86:

    # MARKUS "So, you {i}do{/i} think there's a chance for peace talks?"
    MARKUS "それでは、和平会談の{i}可能性があると考えているんですね。{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/markus_tavern_post_twoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:52
translate ja ev_Markus_tavern_postTwoEmps_4b8ffdf3:

